{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-65-1","title":"Isaiah 65:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The calling of the Gentiles, and the rejection of the Jews, for their incredulity, idolatry, and hypocrisy. 8 A remnant shall be saved. 11 Judgments on the wicked, and blessings on the godly. 17 The blessed state of the new Jerusalem.</p>\n<p>I am sought. 2:2,3; 11:10; 55:5; Ps 22:27; Ro 9:24-26,30; 10:20; Eph 2:12,13 Behold. 40:9; 41:27; 45:22; Joh 1:29 unto. 43:1; 63:19; Ho 1:10; Zec 2:11; 8:22,23; 1Pe 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-2","title":"Isaiah 65:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>spread. Pr 1:24; Mt 23:37; Lu 13:34; 19:41,42; Ro 10:21 a rebellious. 1:2; 63:10; De 9:7; 31:27; Jer 5:23; Eze 2:3-7; Ac 7:51,52 1Th 2:15,16 which. 59:7,8; Ps 36:4; Pr 16:29 after. 55:7; Ge 6:5; Nu 15:39; De 29:19; Ps 81:12; Jer 3:17; 4:14; 7:24 Mt 12:33,34; 15:19; Ro 2:5; Jas 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-3","title":"Isaiah 65:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>A people. 3:8; De 32:16-19,21; 2Ki 17:14-17; 22:17; Ps 78:40,58 Jer 32:30-35; Eze 8:17,18; Mt 23:32-36 to my face. Job 1:11; 2:5 that sacrificeth. 1:29; 66:17; Le 17:5; Jer 3:6; Eze 20:28 altars. Heb. bricks. Ex 20:24,25; 30:1-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-4","title":"Isaiah 65:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>remain. Nu 19:11,16-20; De 18:11; Mt 8:28; Mr 5:2-5; Lu 8:27 which eat. 66:3,17; Le 11:7; De 14:8 broth. or, pieces. Ex 23:19; 34:26; De 14:3,21; Eze 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-5","title":"Isaiah 65:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Stand. Mt 9:11; Lu 5:30; 7:39; 15:2,28-30; 18:9-12; Ac 22:21,22 Ro 2:17-29; Jude 1:19 These. Pr 6:16,17; 10:26; 16:5; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5 nose. or, anger. a fire. De 29:20; 32:20-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-6","title":"Isaiah 65:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>it is. Ex 17:14; De 32:34; Ps 56:8; Mal 3:16; Re 20:12 I will. 42:14; 64:12; Ps 50:3,21 but. Ps 79:12; Jer 16:18; Eze 11:21; 22:31; Joe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-7","title":"Isaiah 65:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Your iniquities. Ex 20:5; Le 26:39; Nu 32:14; Ps 106:6,7; Da 9:8; Mt 23:31-36 burned. 57:7; 1Ki 22:43; 2Ki 12:3; 14:4; 15:35; 16:4; Eze 18:6 blasphemed. Eze 20:27,28 therefore. 6; Jer 5:9,29; 7:19,20; 13:25; Mt 23:32; 1Th 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-8","title":"Isaiah 65:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>6:13; Jer 30:11; Joe 2:14; Am 9:8,9; Mt 24:22; Mr 13:20; Ro 9:27-29 Ro 11:5,6,24-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-9","title":"Isaiah 65:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I will. 10:20-22; 11:11-16; 27:6; Jer 31:36-40; 33:17-26; Eze 36:8-15,24 Eze 37:21-28; 39:25-29; Am 9:11-15; Ob 1:17-21; Zep 3:20 Zec 10:6-12 mine elect. 15,22; Mt 24:22; Ro 11:5-7,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-10","title":"Isaiah 65:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Sharon. 33:9; 35:2; Eze 34:13,14 and the. Jos 7:24-26; Ho 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-11","title":"Isaiah 65:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>they that. 1:28; De 29:25; 1Ch 28:9; Jer 17:13 my holy. 25; 2:2; 11:9; 56:7; 57:13; Ps 132:13; Heb 12:22; Re 21:2,3 prepare. 57:5-10; De 32:17; Jer 2:28; Eze 23:41,42; 1Co 10:20,21 troop. or, Gad. number. or, Meni.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-12","title":"Isaiah 65:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>will I. 3:25; 10:4; Le 26:25; De 32:25; Jer 18:21; 34:17; Eze 14:17-21 Zep 1:4-6; Mt 22:7 because. 50:2; 66:4; 2Ch 36:15,16; Pr 1:24-33; Jer 7:13; Zec 7:7,11-13 Mt 21:34-43; 22:3; Joh 1:11 did evil. 3; 1:16; Jer 16:17 and did. 66:3,4; Pr 1:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-13","title":"Isaiah 65:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>my servants shall eat. Ps 34:10; 37:19,20; Mal 3:18; Lu 14:23,24; 16:24,25 my servants shall rejoice. 61:7; 66:5,14; Da 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-14","title":"Isaiah 65:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>my servants. 24:14; 52:8,9; Job 29:13; Ps 66:4; Jer 31:7; Jas 5:13 ye shall. Mt 8:12; 13:42; 22:13; Lu 13:28; Jas 5:1 vexation. Heb. breaking.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-15","title":"Isaiah 65:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>ye shall. Pr 10:7; Jer 29:22; Zec 8:13 my chosen. 9,22 the Lord. 12; 66:15; Mt 21:41; 22:7; 1Th 2:16 his servants. 62:2; Ac 11:26; Ro 9:26; 1Pe 2:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-16","title":"Isaiah 65:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>he who. Ps 72:17; Jer 4:2 in the God. De 32:4; Ps 31:5; 86:15; Jer 10:10; Joh 1:14,17; 14:6; Heb 6:17,18 he that. 19:18; 45:23-25; 48:1; De 6:13; 10:20; Ps 63:11; Jer 12:16; Zep 1:5 Ro 14:11; Php 2:11 because. 19; 11:16; 12:1; 35:10; 54:4; Jer 31:12; Eze 36:25-27; Da 12:1,11 Zep 3:14-20; Re 20:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-17","title":"Isaiah 65:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I create. 51:16; 66:22; 2Pe 3:13; Re 21:1-5 the former. Jer 3:16 into mind. Heb. upon the heart.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-18","title":"Isaiah 65:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>12:4-6; 42:10-12; 44:23; 49:13; 51:11; 52:7-10; 66:10-14; Ps 67:3-5 Ps 96:10-13; 98:1-9; Zep 3:14; Zec 9:9; 1Th 5:16; Re 11:15-18 Re 19:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-19","title":"Isaiah 65:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I will. 62:4,5; So 3:11; Jer 32:41; Zep 3:17; Lu 15:3,5 the voice of weeping. 25:8; 35:10; 51:3,11; 60:20; Jer 31:12; Re 7:17; 21:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-20","title":"Isaiah 65:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>There shall. De 4:40; Job 5:26; Ps 34:12 but. 3:11; Ec 8:12; Ro 2:5-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-21","title":"Isaiah 65:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>62:8,9; Le 26:16; De 28:30-33; Jud 6:1-6; Jer 31:4,5; Am 9:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-22","title":"Isaiah 65:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>for as. 9,15; Ge 5:5,27; Le 26:16; Ps 92:12-14; Re 20:3-5 long enjoy. Heb. make them continue long, or, shall wearout.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-23","title":"Isaiah 65:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>shall. 49:4; 55:2; 61:9; Le 26:3-10,20,22,29; De 28:3-12,38-42 Ho 9:11-14; Hag 1:6; 2:19; Mal 3:10; 1Co 15:58 for. 61:9; Ge 12:2; 17:7; Ps 115:14,15; Jer 32:38,39; Zec 10:8,9 Ac 2:39; 3:25,26; Ro 4:16; 9:7,8; Ga 3:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-24","title":"Isaiah 65:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>58:9; Ps 32:5; 50:15; 91:15; Da 9:20-23; 10:12; Mr 11:24 Lu 15:18-20; Ac 4:31; 10:30-32; 12:5-16; 1Jo 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-65-25","title":"Isaiah 65:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":65,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":65,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>wolf. 11:6-9; 35:9; Ac 9:1,19-21; 1Co 6:9-11; Tit 3:3-7 dust. Ge 3:14,15; Ro 16:20; Re 12:7-9; 20:2,3 shall not. 2:4; 11:9; Mic 4:3 my. 11; Eze 43:11; Zec 8:3; 14:20,21; Re 14:1</p>"}]}